    "recommendation": "Keep payments on 1.3 until the duplicate-posting fault in 1.5 is found. The ledger issue has been escalated to the operations team as soon priority: they must find and correct the duplicate payment records, which the data check now counts at 19, up from 14 earlier. Before the reconciliation batch runs again, check it will not hold the ledger lock this long."
